  backgroundNameEn: "Rich Heir"
  descriptionEn: "You were born into a wealthy family and raised in luxury. For this mapping trip to Xuri Village, your family packed plenty of travel money for you. You don't lack money; you lack a chance to prove you're not useless.\n\nYou get the consumable Some Coins."
